Pokémon TCG AI with FPGA inference
Project implementation and modifications by le21-j and contributors.

This project includes code adapted from "Reinforcement Learning and MCTS sample code"
by Kiyota (Kaggle user kiyotah):
https://www.kaggle.com/code/kiyotah/reinforcement-learning-and-mcts-sample-code
The upstream notebook is published under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The adapted notebook retains the original Transformer, sparse feature encoders,
MCTS, and batching function/class definitions. Local modifications cover runtime
setup, vocabulary bounds, configurable run sizes, draw handling, partial batches,
native cleanup, checkpoints, and agent export. The portable RL modules make
additional search/belief and inference integration changes described in their files.
